    "en": "In the past 8 hours the ecosystem added 46 new plugins (19,226 total), with 131 new stars on the official repo and 358,343 weekly npm downloads. Ebony-Vinyl/dsh-our-free-model led growth at +524 stars, while a health score of 39 and 15,116 plugins stale for 7+ days show attention and maintenance are diverging.",
